XO Game Using Minimax Algorithm 
Introduction 
This project is a Tic Tac Toe (XO) game developed using Python and Tkinter. 
 The game uses Artificial Intelligence through the Minimax Algorithm, allowing the computer 
to make smart decisions and play optimally against the user . 
 
Project Objectives 
● Build a graphical XO game . 
● Implement Artificial Intelligence . 
● Use the Minimax Algorithm . 
● Add different difficulty levels . 
● Learn Game Theory and Search Algorithms . 
 
Technologies Used 
Technology Purpose 
Python Main Programming Language 
Tkinter GUI Development 
Minimax Algorithm Artificial Intelligence 
 
