Difficulty Levels 
Easy 
The computer chooses random moves . 
Medium 
The computer mixes : 
● Random moves 
● Smart Minimax moves 
Hard 
The computer always uses the Minimax Algorithm and becomes very difficult to beat . 
 
GUI Features 
The graphical interface includes : 
● XO game board 
● Restart button 
● Difficulty selection 
● AI opponent 
 
Sample Minimax Code 
def minimax(is_maximizing): 
 
   if check_winner('O'): 
       return 1 
 
   if check_winner('X'): 
       return -1 
 
   if is_draw(): 
       return 0 
 
