Time Complexity 
The complexity of Minimax is : 
O(bd)O(b^d)O(bd ( 
Where : 
● b = branching factor 
● d = depth of the game tree 
 
Conclusion 
This project demonstrates how Artificial Intelligence can be applied in games using the 
Minimax Algorithm. 
 The game provides an interactive experience while helping understand important AI 
concepts such as search algorithms and decision trees